data: {"text":"1. That the Applicant has been falsely implicated in FIR No. 124/2026 dated 15.03.2026, registered at Police"}

data: {"text":" Station Kotwali, under Sections 303 and 351 of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023, and seeks regular"}

data: {"text":" bail in the aforesaid matter.\n\n2. That the Applicant submits that he has been falsely implicated in the aforesaid FIR due to a pre"}

data: {"text":"-existing land dispute with the complainant. The allegations leveled against the Applicant are entirely baseless and motivated by malice and"}

data: {"text":" vendetta arising out of civil disputes between the parties.\n\n3. That the Applicant respectfully submits that he was"}

data: {"text":" not present at the time and place of the alleged incident and has credible witnesses who can establish his alibi beyond any"}

data: {"text":" shadow of doubt. The Applicant was arrested on 16.03.2026 and has been languishing in judicial custody since then without any justifiable cause.\n\n4. That the"}

data: {"text":" Applicant has been falsely implicated in the present case due to personal animosity and civil disputes with the complainant. The allegations"}

data: {"text":" are completely fabricated and the Applicant is being made a scapegoat in the matter. The complainant has mis"}

data: {"text":"used the provisions of criminal law to settle personal scores.\n\n5. That the Applicant is a resp"}

data: {"text":"ectable member of society with deep roots in the community and poses no flight risk whatsoever. He has permanent"}

data: {"text":" residence and family ties in the locality and shall remain available"}

data: {"text":" for trial proceedings as and when required by this Hon'ble Court.\n\n6."}

data: {"text":" That the Applicant has no previous criminal antecedents and has never been involved in any criminal activity. His conduct has always"}

data: {"text":" been law-abiding and he enjoys good reputation in society. This is the"}

data: {"text":" first time he has been entangled in any legal proceedings.\n\n7. That the Applicant has been fully"}

data: {"text":" cooperating with the investigation and shall continue to do so. He has appeared before the investigating agency whenever called upon and has never attempted to obst"}

data: {"text":"ruct the course of justice or tamper with evidence in any manner.\n\n8. That continued inc"}

data: {"text":"arceration of the Applicant would be a violation of his fundamental right to life and personal liberty as"}

data: {"text":" guaranteed under Article 21 of the Constitution of India, especially when the allegations are false and motivated.\n\n9. That the investigation"}

data: {"text":" in the present case is pending and there is no likelihood of the Applicant tampering with evidence"}

data: {"text":" or influencing witnesses. The Applicant undertakes to abide by any conditions that this Hon'ble Court may d"}

data: {"text":"eem fit to impose while granting bail.\n\n10. That considering the overall circumstances of the case, the false nature of allegations"}

data: {"text":", absence of any criminal record, and the Applicant's willingness to cooperate with the investigation, the interest of justice would"}

data: {"text":" be served by granting bail to the Applicant."}

